Error [E0329]: a nested guard body needs braces
  --> tests/ui/subjectless_guard_direct_nesting.jet:2:16
    |
  2 |     if true -> if false -> print("never")
    |                ^^
 Why: a braceless guard owns exactly one non-`if` statement, so direct nesting would be ambiguous
 Fix: wrap the nested `if` in `{ ... }`
